        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) When an Employee's Standard Rate has been reduced and the effective date of such reduction falls within the twenty-six (26) week period preceding Layoff, the Standard Rate used shall be that in effect immediately preceding the reduction from the higher Standard Rate which was effective within such twenty-six (26) week period if it is higher than the Standard Rate in effect as of the date of Layoff.",
